# Testing

## Web unit tests (Vitest)

- Location: `apps/web/src/**/__tests__/*.spec.ts` or colocated `*.spec.ts`
- Run: `cd apps/web && npm run test:unit -- --run`
- Mock `@/api/*` and Pinia stores; use `@vue/test-utils`

## API integration tests

- Project: `apps/api.tests/` (PostgreSQL `enterprise_starter_tests` by default)
- `CustomWebApplicationFactory` — Postgres connection
- Suites cover cookie/CSRF auth, forced password changes, global RBAC, user lifecycle, audit, compile-time module extension, empty production registry, and deploy hardening

```bash
dotnet test apps/api.tests/Api.Tests.csproj
```

## E2E (Playwright)

- Package: `e2e/`
- `playwright.config.ts` starts api + web against PostgreSQL
- Prefer same-origin cookie/CSRF auth (`VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1`)
- Tests: `e2e/tests/*.spec.ts`
- Run: `cd e2e && npm test`

## CI alignment

Match `.github/workflows/ci.yml`: NuGet vuln gate → api tests → web (prod npm audit + type-check/lint/unit/build) → e2e.
